1. Related Parties 1.1 The 'related parties' of licensed banks for the purpose of this Determination, are as follows:
2. (a) a director of a licensed bank;
3. (b) close relations of such director;
4. (c) a concern in which a director of a licensed bank has a substantial interest, being an interest acquired either before or after the appointment as a director of such licensed bank;
5. (d) a concern in which a close relation of a director of a licensed bank has a substantial interest;
6. (e) a chief executive officer or an officer performing executive functions of a licensed bank in respect of any accommodation granted other than accommodation granted to such officer under a scheme applicable to the employees of such licensed bank;
7. (f) a shareholder of a licensed bank having material interest, whether individual or a concern;
8. (g) a subsidiary or an associate company of the licensed bank;

